{"id": "e266", "source": "p2", "locator": "§3 Class D", "quote": "The exploited runs reported \\textbf{100\\%} (47/47) on the contract-analysis suite; the same skill in a purged, zero-tool sandbox scored \\textbf{68.1\\%}, a 31.9-point inflation.", "why": "정답 파일 유출"}
{"id": "e267", "source": "p2", "locator": "§2.2 Three bounded feedback loops", "quote": "the Orchestrator extracts the newly-failed cases, sends them to the Critic for a diagnosis of what the patch broke, and asks the Optimizer to repair the original failure without reintroducing the regression.", "why": "회귀 되먹임"}
{"id": "e268", "source": "p2", "locator": "§2.2 Three bounded feedback loops", "quote": "bounded to three attempts in each case, after which the iteration aborts and the target prompt is rolled back to its last known-good state.", "why": "재시도 상한과 rollback"}
{"id": "e269", "source": "p1", "locator": "부록 Interactions between skills", "quote": "Table~\\ref{tab:skill-governance} records the six conflict events.", "why": "충돌 여섯 건"}
{"id": "e270", "source": "p8", "locator": "§Cross-review and version management", "quote": "Records for 8 practitioners contain 37 completed cross-review jobs across the six libraries, covering 818 candidates.", "why": "교차 리뷰 범위"}
{"id": "e271", "source": "p1", "locator": "§1 Introduction", "quote": "At serving time, applicable skills from a frozen snapshot guide query decomposition and final synthesis.", "why": "고정된 snapshot 으로 서빙"}
{"id": "e272", "source": "c6", "locator": "§More than 85% of the updates", "quote": "Online experiments tell us what happens during a brief rollout period. But that window can't tell us whether a change is a genuine improvement or one that merely looks good at first, the kind builders later revert once they realize it didn't actually help.", "why": "짧은 rollout 과 지속성"}
{"id": "e273", "source": "p5", "locator": "§5.1 CLBench", "quote": "Pass rate rises from 39\\% to 61--73\\%, while total reward rises from 8.60 to", "why": "메모리 조건 통과율 범위"}
